Nothing Souffle.

Una receta que imprime la palabra NOTHING.

Ingredients.
78 g nachos
79 ml oil
84 g tomatoes
72 g ham
73 g icing sugar
71 g garlic

Method.
Put garlic into the mixing bowl.
Put nachos into the mixing bowl.
Put icing sugar into the mixing bowl.
Put ham into the mixing bowl.
Put tomatoes into the mixing bowl.
Put oil into the mixing bowl.
Put nachos into the mixing bowl.
Liquefy contents of the mixing bowl.
Pour contents of the mixing bowl into the baking dish.

Serves 1.
